WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.919
- [Man] One of the 
challenges I face all the time

00:00:01.919 --> 00:00:04.338
with some of these 
students is anxiety.

00:00:04.338 --> 00:00:06.078
How I can help them--
- [Gary] Yeah.

00:00:06.078 --> 00:00:10.702
- [Man] see that they 
can do more than they think

00:00:10.702 --> 00:00:12.179
and that they're 
stronger than they know.

00:00:12.179 --> 00:00:14.473
How would you 
articulate or explain to them?

00:00:14.473 --> 00:00:15.641
- [Gary] You know how I do it.

00:00:15.641 --> 00:00:18.672
I'm doing it. I put 
pressure on the true answers.

00:00:18.672 --> 00:00:22.780
Insecurity is the seed 
that creates all these issues.

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:23.627
- [Man] Absolutely.

00:00:23.627 --> 00:00:24.482
- And so I'm 
trying to figure out

00:00:24.482 --> 00:00:26.277
why they didn't 
build self-esteem,

00:00:26.277 --> 00:00:28.737
who didn't build self-esteem and
the reason I bring up mom

00:00:28.737 --> 00:00:31.073
is like Jesus, it's 
such big percentage of it.

00:00:31.073 --> 00:00:33.992
Mom or dad is like 80% of it.

00:00:33.992 --> 00:00:36.203
It's just, you know, I do 
this a lot. I'm fascinated.

00:00:36.203 --> 00:00:38.497
Listen, my dad, 
I don't talk a lot about this.

00:00:38.497 --> 00:00:40.040
That's what happened to my dad.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.208
I'm so impressed by him.

00:00:41.208 --> 00:00:44.920
The way my grandmother 
parented my dad is unacceptable.

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:46.255
That's the only 
word I can think of.

00:00:46.255 --> 00:00:49.466
So, I'm fascinated by it 
because I had the reverse.

00:00:49.466 --> 00:00:51.635
I'm so perfectly 
parented by my mother,

00:00:51.635 --> 00:00:52.678
I'm unstoppable.

00:00:52.678 --> 00:00:56.348
I feel guilty that I'm so
emotionally grounded and strong,

00:00:56.348 --> 00:00:57.683
that's why I'm giving it to you.

00:00:57.683 --> 00:01:00.269
What do you 
think's happening up here?

00:01:00.269 --> 00:01:02.521
I feel guilty that 
I have it so good mentally.

00:01:02.521 --> 00:01:05.565
There's nothing anybody 
can do to my mental state.

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:06.886
It's insane.

00:01:06.886 --> 00:01:11.363
I am so weird, guys. 
(audience laughter)

00:01:11.363 --> 00:01:13.713
Nothing hits, 
it's like I'm numb.

00:01:13.713 --> 00:01:16.493
And so, I go right to the core.

00:01:16.493 --> 00:01:17.940
I do it when I see it sometimes.

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:21.164
I'm like, "Hey, you are 
unbelievable and you think

00:01:21.164 --> 00:01:22.916
"you're shit, that's bad.

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:24.418
"We need to talk about this.

00:01:24.418 --> 00:01:26.753
"Tell me everything 
about your childhood."

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:29.131
You know? 
And I just go there and

00:01:29.131 --> 00:01:31.008
sometimes you 
get a little break.

00:01:31.008 --> 00:01:33.635
But what's really fun is 
they start thinking about it

00:01:33.635 --> 00:01:35.345
and it changes behavior.

00:01:35.345 --> 00:01:38.181
I get an email every day that
says that they disconnected

00:01:38.181 --> 00:01:40.058
from somebody in 
their inner circle

00:01:40.058 --> 00:01:41.351
and for the last six months,

00:01:41.351 --> 00:01:44.563
they're breathing for the 
first time in their lives.

00:01:44.563 --> 00:01:48.066
It is not easy to 
break up with your brother.

00:01:48.066 --> 00:01:50.694
It is not easy to 
break up with your spouse.

00:01:50.694 --> 00:01:53.363
It is not easy to 
break up with your father

00:01:53.363 --> 00:01:55.866
but that's 
actually the binary move

00:01:55.866 --> 00:01:57.242
if they're the 
poison of your life.

00:01:57.242 --> 00:01:59.578
So, A,

00:01:59.578 --> 00:02:01.788
if that's your reality, 
you need to think.

00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:02.497
'Cause guess what?

00:02:02.497 --> 00:02:03.915
You have one life.

00:02:03.915 --> 00:02:06.668
And you don't want to be 73 when
your parent passes away

00:02:06.668 --> 00:02:08.688
and finally start breathing.

00:02:08.688 --> 00:02:11.048
B, if that is not your life,

00:02:11.048 --> 00:02:12.758
you need to drive 
home right now and

00:02:12.758 --> 00:02:14.441
kiss your parents in the face.

00:02:14.441 --> 00:02:19.056
(upbeat music)

